      "key": "Pierre",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hmm... maybe if I get on the governor's good side he'll give my business a tax break...#$b#I wonder if he likes aged whiskey?#$e#Now if only the Mayor would stop shmoozing with him all afternoon.",
      "translation": "Hmm... Možná když si guvernéra nakloním, poskytne mému podniku daňovou úlevu...#$b#Zajímalo by mě, jestli má rád vyzrálou whisky.#$e#Kdyby se mu tak starosta celé odpoledne nepodbízel.",
