    {
      "target": "Data/Festivals/summer11",
      "key": "Penny",
      "field": null,
      "source": "We do this festival every year to give the governor a taste of everything the valley has to offer.#$e#Mayor Lewis hopes it will get the governor on our good side. That's why he's so neurotic about the way the soup tastes.",
      "translation": "Tenhle festival pořádáme každý rok, aby guvernér ochutnal všechno, co údolí nabízí.#$e#Starosta Lewis doufá, že si tím získá jeho přízeň. Proto je tak posedlý chutí polévky.",
      "sourceSHA256": "5367be4ba7d6ab8056ad04dc60e9b86735634eea13f9fa9045bca17f45a9bb59",
      "translationSHA256": "c0109dc11d38776859aa313ff642a75bf2f9614d3296402ef6f68ff87badeefa",
